{
  "id": "GEN.12",
  "number": "12",
  "bookId": "GEN",
  "reference": "Tuk 12",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 20,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "12",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "GEN 12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "12",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ciöt Kuɔth kɛ Ab-ram",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nɛ̈nɛ jɛ, täämɛ cu Kuoth Nhial Ab-ram ku jiök i̱, “Jiɛc rɔ ro̱o̱lu kɛnɛ watku kɛ thok duëël guur kä wër ro̱o̱l mi bä nyuɔ̱th ji̱. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bä do̱r mi di̱i̱t cak kɛ ji̱. Bä ji̱ poth kä bä kɛ̈kdu jak kä jɔc kɛ ɣöö bi naath nöŋ puɔ̱th. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bä nɛy diaal tin puɔthkɛ ji̱ poth, kä bä tin diaal tin lamkɛ ji̱ lam. Kä döör diaal wi̱i̱ muɔ̱ɔ̱n baakɛ poth kɛ ciötdu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.12.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Min cɛ min ca la̱r jɛ ɛ Kuoth Nhial liŋ, cuɛ jiɛn ni kä kɛɛl, kä cu Lɔt wä kɛ jɛ kɛɛl. Kä mëë jiɛcɛ kä Ɣa-ran, Ab-ram runkɛ kɛ run ti jiɛn bärɔw wi̱cdɛ dhieec. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ ciekdɛ ni Tha-ray naŋ kɛnɛ gat däman ni Lɔt kɛnɛ kuak diaal tëë la nyinkiɛn, kɛnɛ nɛy diaal tëë ci kɛn kɛ jëk rɔ kä Ɣa-ran, kä cukɛ tɛth raar a wäkɛ ro̱o̱l Kɛ-naan. Mëë cikɛ cu cop ɛn thɔ̱ŋi i̱, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "cu Ab-ram rɛy wec cu luk a räth guäth jiaath Morɛ in di̱i̱t kä Cɛ-kɛm. Ɛn guäth ɛmɔ te ji̱ Kɛ-naan thi̱n ɛn wi̱c. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛ jɛn cu Kuoth Nhial rɔ cu nyuɔ̱th Ab-ram kä cuɛ jɛ jiök i̱, “Bä wec ɛmɛ ka̱m kuayku.” Inɔ cu Ab-ram Kuoth Nhial in ci rɔ nyuɔ̱th jɛ ta̱th yi̱k. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛn wi̱ni cuɛ ɣo̱th pe̱e̱k wec in te kä käny ca̱ŋ dhɔaar in cɔal i̱ Beth-ɛl, dhɔɔr in tekɛ bi̱eli, kä cuɛ kɛmɛdɛ pua̱t piny thi̱n, te Beth-ɛl kui̱ konyä ca̱ŋ kä te Aay kui̱ känyä ca̱ŋ. Kä ɛn wi̱ni cuɛ Kuoth Nhial ta̱th yi̱k kä cuɛ jɛ pal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Ab-ram ja̱lɛ cuɔ̱p ɛ lɛm lɛm wädɛ pe̱e̱k rööl Kɛ-naan in cɔal i̱ Nɛ-gɛb.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.12.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ab-ram kä I-jëp",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë ci wec ku tekɛ buɔth mi di̱i̱t, cu Ab-ram rɔ bar ro̱o̱l I-jëp kɛ ɣöö bɛ wä cieŋ thi̱n ala ram mi duundɛ puɔt kɛ buɔth kɛ ɣöö ci buɔth di̱t. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mëë ci ku thia̱k ni ɣöö bɛ ro̱l I-jëp ŋäthikä, cuɛ ciekdɛ ni Tha-ray jiök i̱, “Täämɛ guic ɛ, ɣän ŋa̱cä jɛ ɛn ɣöö ɛ ji̱n ciekdä mi tekɛ maan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mi wä ji̱ rööl I-jëp ji̱ wä nɛn, bikɛ jɛ cu lar i̱, ‘Mɛmɛ ɛ jɛn ciekdɛ,’ kä bikɛ ɣä cu näk, kä min te ni jɛn thi̱n bikɛ ji̱ päl a tëk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mal ɛ lar i̱ ɛ ji̱n nyimaar kɛ ɣöö dëë mal cu jek kɛ ji̱, kɛnɛ ɣöö dëë tëkdä kän kɛ kui̱du.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mëë ci Ab-ram coth rɛy rööl I-jëp cu ji̱ I-jëp Tha-ray nɛn ɛn ɣöö ɛ ciek mi tekɛ maan mi di̱i̱t. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë ci kua̱r lätni Pɛro jɛ nɛn, cukɛ jɛ wä liëk gɔɔy ciek ɛmɔ, kä cua jɛ naŋ cieŋdɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Pɛro Ab-ram ciɛŋ ni gɔaa kɛ kui̱dɛ. Kä cuɛ rɔ jëk det kɛnɛ ɣɔ̱k kɛ tut muɔ̱li kɛ kuaany wutni kɛnɛ män kɛ ŋut muɔ̱li kɛnɛ thɔ̱a̱rɔa̱a̱li. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.12.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 12:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä nɛ̈nɛ jɛ, cu Kuoth Nhial Pɛro kɛnɛ ji̱ cieeŋdɛ moc kɛ riɛk mi di̱i̱t kɛ kui̱ ciëk Ab-ram ni Tha-ray. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.12.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.12.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 12:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mëë ci riɛk ɛmɔ cop, cu Pɛro Ab-ram jäk kä raan kä cuɛ jɛ jiök i̱, “Ɛŋu ɛnɛ ci lät kä ɣä mi? Ɛŋu mi /keni ɣä jiök i̱ jɛn ɛ ciekdu mɔ? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.12.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.12.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 12:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛŋu mëë laari jɛ i̱ ɛ nyimaar? Kɛ kui̱c ɛmɔ cä jak kä ciekdä. Kä täämɛ, ciekdu mɔn, naŋ ɛ kä wër.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.12.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.12.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 12:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ jɛ kuëny wutni ti ba jɛ nam kɛnɛ ciekdɛ kɛ nyinkɛ diaal.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.12.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.12.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
